WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Research TV — jouleos (60s) Narrator Brian

1
00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:06.830
Every layer under a modern autonomous agent tracks memory bytes and wall-clock slices,

2
00:00:06.830 --> 00:00:10.161
yet none refuses an unbudgeted energy spike.

3
00:00:10.681 --> 00:00:16.390
JouleOS lays out checkable architectural requirements: meter honestly,

4
00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:21.610
cap grants hierarchically, and refuse budget violations cleanly.

5
00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:33.754
Exhaustive algebraic tests over 78,400 sensor-attribution pairs verify that composing stages preserves exact epistemic honesty.

6
00:00:34.274 --> 00:00:40.005
Three hundred ten Rust tests verify canonical det-CBOR signing,

7
00:00:40.005 --> 00:00:45.553
Falsifier 6 drift withholding, and multi-stage joule rollups.

8
00:00:46.073 --> 00:00:49.714
Framed honestly as a review, requirement spec,

9
00:00:49.714 --> 00:00:56.204
and verified Rust spine—never claiming a deployed bare-metal OS where none exists.
